{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34183","headline":"杂讽九首 八 · 陆龟蒙","name":"杂讽九首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"横笛喝秋风，清商入疏越。\n君居不夜城，肯怨孤戍月。\n吴兵甚犀利，太白光突兀。\n日已费千金，厪闻侵一拨。\n岂无恶年少，纵酒游侠窟。\n募爲敢死军，去以枭叛卒。\n岂无中林士，贯穿学问骨。\n兵法五十家，浩荡如溟渤。\n高悬鹿皮睡，清涧时依樾。\n分已诺烟霞，全遗事干谒。\n既非格猛兽，未可轻华髪。\n北面师其谋，几能止征伐。\n何妨秦堇勇，又有曹刿说。\n尧舜尚询刍，公乎听无忽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}